{
  "info": {
    "name": "EduTrace API (MVP)",
    "description": "Colección para probar el backend MVP de EduTrace.\n\n1. Arranca el backend: `uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000`.\n2. Ejecuta un **Login** (guarda el token solo).\n3. Llama cualquier endpoint.\n\nPara correr todo en orden: botón **Run collection**. Las carpetas 1 → 4 son el flujo completo: el estudiante entrega, el docente aprueba, el estudiante ve la retroalimentación, y al final los errores esperados.\n\nVariables (pestaña *Variables* de la colección): `baseUrl`, `token`, `cursoId`, `tareaId`, `entregaId`. Los scripts de *Tests* las van llenando.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "cursoId",
      "value": "c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"
    },
    {
      "key": "juanId",
      "value": "e0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"
    },
    {
      "key": "tareaId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "entregaId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "notificacionId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Estudiante entrega código",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login estudiante (Juan)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"jperezg@javeriana.edu.co\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"estudiante123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Guarda el token en la variable {{token}}. Todas las demás peticiones lo envían como Authorization: Bearer {{token}}."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const r = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", r.token);",
                  "pm.test(\"Rol estudiante\", () => pm.expect(r.usuario.rol).to.eql(\"estudiante\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Mis tareas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/estudiantes/me/cursos/{{cursoId}}/tareas",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "estudiantes",
                "me",
                "cursos",
                "{{cursoId}}",
                "tareas"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const t = pm.response.json().find(x => x.titulo.startsWith(\"Tarea 4\"));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tareaId\", t.tareaId);",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene la Tarea 4\", () => pm.expect(t).to.be.an(\"object\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Subir código (revisión previa)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tareas/{{tareaId}}/entregas",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tareas",
                "{{tareaId}}",
                "entregas"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tipo\": \"revision\",\n  \"archivos\": [\n    {\n      \"nombre\": \"promedio.cpp\",\n      \"contenido\": \"#include <iostream>\\nusing namespace std;\\n\\nint main() {\\n    int notas[5] = {40, 35, 50, 28, 45};\\n    int suma = 0;\\n    for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) suma += notas[i];\\n    cout << \\\"Promedio: \\\" << suma / 5 << endl;\\n    return 0;\\n}\\n\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "tipo 'revision' no gasta intentos, así que la colección se puede correr muchas veces. Cambia a 'oficial' para gastar un intento (máximo 3)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 202\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "const e = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"entregaId\", e.id);",
                  "pm.test(\"No cuenta como intento\", () => pm.expect(e.numeroIntento).to.eql(null));",
                  "pm.test(\"El estudiante aún no ve retroalimentación\", () => pm.expect(e.retroalimentacion).to.eql(null));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Ver mi entrega (aún sin retroalimentación)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/entregas/{{entregaId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "entregas",
                "{{entregaId}}"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Sigue oculta hasta que el docente apruebe\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().retroalimentacion).to.eql(null));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
